        }
      ],
      "impact": "The STM32's backup domain (RTC, backup registers) is unpowered; a floating VBAT can also cause increased current consumption or unreliable operation.",
      "confidence": 0.8
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain an anomaly: the STM32's VBAT pin is left unconnected even though the design has no battery, which can lead to backup-domain and power issues."
}

